<title>USA: AccuMed says ships diagnostic systems.</title>
<headline>AccuMed says ships diagnostic systems.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuMed International Inc said it began initial shipments of its AcCell and TracCell systems to Europe to fulfill its contract with Leica Microscopy and Systems GmbH, of Germany.</p>
<p>Shipments have been delivered to Leica, as well as to selected clinical diagnostic laboratories in Germany, Italy and France, AccuMed said.</p>
<p>The TracCell Specimen Mapping System helps screen cervical cytology specimens and is integrated into the AcCell cytology workstation, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
